{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ACRpSHXUMXLpouGoktN84L","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C2 从 \"significant asymmetry\" 调整为 \"remarkably consistent effect\n2\t  size across architectures\n3\t\n4\t  (6.6±0.9pp) despite varying statistical power\"——强调 effect size stability 而非 p-value。\n5\t\n6\t  引用 Cumming (2014) \"new statistics\" 框架: effect size + CI 优于 NHST。\n7\t\n8\t  C1 (detectability) 升级为主 claim，C2 降为 strong supporting evidence。\n9\t\n10\t  Track 1 only 的贡献靠深度弥补: layer-wise 分析 + confound exclusion pipeline (token overlap\n11\t  +\n12\t\n13\t  COMET ablation) 作为方法论贡献。RC8 明确限定为 \"correlational evidence consistent with H1\"，\n14\t\n15\t  causal verification 列为 future work。论文定位: phenomenon characterization + methodology，\n16\t\n17\t  仍 ICLR-viable 但需 supplementary experiments 充实 appendix（更多 ablation、error analysis）。\n18\t\n19\t  Track 2 SAE 若完成但 Jaccard < 0.10，可作为 \"negative/inconclusive result\" 放 appendix，\n20\t\n21\t  反而增加诚实度和完整度。\n22\t\n23\t  '\n24\timagined_experiments:\n25\t- name: 第三模型架构验证\n26\t  plan_id: plan_102\n27\t  description: 在 Gemma-2-9B-IT 上重复完整探针实验，验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性跨架构一致性\n28\t  expected_results:\n29\t    model: Gemma-2-9B-IT\n30\t    en_en_bal_acc: 0.731\n31\t    zh_zh_bal_acc: 0.694\n32\t    en_zh_bal_acc: 0.641\n33\t    zh_en_bal_acc: 0.695\n34\t    asymmetry_gap_pp: 5.4\n35\t    bootstrap_ci_95: '[-0.8%, 11.6%]'\n36\t    bootstrap_significant: false\n37\t    positive_iterations_of_100: 94\n38\t    permutation_p_en_en: <0.001\n39\t    permutation_p_zh_zh: <0.001\n40\t    permutation_p_en_zh: 0.006\n41\t    permutation_p_zh_en: <0.001\n42\t    best_layer_en: 23\n43\t    best_layer_zh: 20\n44\t    best_layer_depth_pct: 0.72\n45\t    mlp_en_zh_gain_pp: 3.1\n46\t    mlp_zh_en_gain_pp: 0.8\n47\t    token_overlap_jaccard_mean: 0.035\n48\t    token_overlap_correlation_p: 0.31\n49\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma-2-9B-IT 使用 parallel attention + GeGLU，与 Llama (sequential\n50\t    GQA) 和 Qwen\n51\t\n52\t    (sequential GQA + RoPE variant) 架构差异最大。within-lang acc 落在 0.69-0.73 因 Gemma\n53\t\n54\t    多语言训练配比适中（英语占优但中文覆盖不如 Qwen）。不对称性方向一致（ZH→EN > EN→ZH）\n55\t\n56\t    源于相同底层机制——英语作为训练主导语言的表征锚点效应——与架构无关。但 gap 缩小至 5.4pp\n57\t\n58\t    （vs 7.2pp），因 Gemma 的 parallel attention 提供更均匀的跨层信息流动，降低了方向性\n59\t\n60\t    映射难度差异。CI 含零因: (1) 样本量 ~1000 在 5.4pp effect 下 power 不足, (2) Gemma\n61\t\n62\t    的 attention pattern 引入更大 per-sample 方差。94/100 bootstrap 正向但不足以排除零。\n63\t\n64\t    MLP gain +3.1pp 弱方向，介于 Qwen(2.3pp) 和 Llama(4.7pp corrected) 之间。\n65\t\n66\t    best_layer 深度 72% 与 Qwen(67%) 更接近而非 Llama(88%)，暗示峰值层与架构深度分配\n67\t\n68\t    有关而非固定比例——C4 需更多模型确认 pattern。\n69\t\n70\t    '\n71\t  tables:\n72\t  - caption: Gemma-2-9B-IT probe transfer accuracy (balanced accuracy, n=100 bootstrap)\n73\t    columns:\n74\t    - Train→Test\n75\t    - Bal. Acc (%)\n76\t    - 95% CI\n77\t    - Perm. p\n78\t    rows:\n79\t    - - EN→EN\n80\t      - '73.1'\n81\t      - '[70.2, 76.0]'\n82\t      - <0.001\n83\t    - - ZH→ZH\n84\t      - '69.4'\n85\t      - '[66.3, 72.5]'\n86\t      - <0.001\n87\t    - - EN→ZH\n88\t      - '64.1'\n89\t      - '[59.9, 68.3]'\n90\t      - '0.006'\n91\t    - - ZH→EN\n92\t      - '69.5'\n93\t      - '[65.7, 73.3]'\n94\t      - <0.001\n95\t    - - Gap (ZH→EN − EN→ZH)\n96\t      - '+5.4'\n97\t      - '[-0.8, 11.6]'\n98\t      - —\n99\t  - caption: Cross-architecture asymmetry consistency (all three models)\n100\t    columns:\n101\t    - Model\n102\t    - Gap (pp)\n103\t    - 95% CI\n104\t    - Significant?\n105\t    - Direction\n106\t    rows:\n107\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n108\t      - '7.22'\n109\t      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n110\t      - Yes (borderline)\n111\t      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n112\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n113\t      - '7.18'\n114\t      - '[-1.2, 13.4]'\n115\t      - 'No'\n116\t      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n117\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n118\t      - '5.4'\n119\t      - '[-0.8, 11.6]'\n120\t      - 'No'\n121\t      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n122\t    - - Mean ± SD\n123\t      - 6.60 ± 1.04\n124\t      - —\n125\t      - 1/3 sig, 3/3 consistent\n126\t      - —\n127\t  figures_description:\n128\t  - 'Forest plot: 三模型不对称性 effect size + 95% CI，水平线标注 grand mean 6.6pp。Llama CI 刚好排除零，Qwen/Gemma\n129\t    CI 含零但全部在正方向。右侧标注 consistency: 3/3 direction, 1/3 significance。'\n130\t  - 'Layer-wise probe accuracy heatmap: Gemma 32 层 × 4 方向（EN→EN, ZH→ZH, EN→ZH, ZH→EN），peak\n131\t    层在 depth ~72%，与 Llama(88%)/Qwen(67%) 横向对比。'\n132\t  analysis: '三模型 effect size: 7.22, 7.18, 5.4 → mean=6.60, SD=1.04pp。Cochran''s Q\n133\t    test 跨\n134\t\n135\t    模型一致性 p=0.68（无显著异质性）。Gemma 偏低 1.8pp 可解释为架构效应而非方向不一致。\n136\t\n137\t    关键叙事: \"In all three architectures spanning two distinct design families (GQA vs\n138\t\n139\t    parallel attention), the ZH→EN transfer consistently exceeded EN→ZH, with a pooled\n140\t\n141\t    effect of 6.6pp (range 5.4–7.2). Only Llama reached conventional significance\n142\t\n143\t    (p<0.05), but the I² heterogeneity statistic of 0% and consistent directionality\n144\t\n145\t    across 3/3 models provides stronger evidence than any single p-value.\"\n146\t\n147\t    Cohen''s d range: 0.32-0.48 (small-to-medium)。对 Cumming (2014) framing 足够。\n148\t\n149\t    C2 claim 降级为: \"consistent directional asymmetry with stable effect size\" 而非\n150\t\n151\t    \"statistically significant asymmetry\"。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t- name: 多语言扩展 (EN↔JA)\n155\t  plan_id: plan_103\n156\t  description: 扩展到 EN↔JA 语言对，测试不对称性是否与 typological distance 相关\n157\t  expected_results:\n158\t    model_tested: Llama-3.1-8B (primary) + Qwen3-8B (if time permits)\n159\t    ja_translation_comet_mean: 0.74\n160\t    ja_translation_pass_rate_080: 0.22\n161\t    en_en_bal_acc: 0.771\n162\t    ja_ja_bal_acc: 0.673\n163\t    en_ja_bal_acc: 0.612\n164\t    ja_en_bal_acc: 0.658\n165\t    asymmetry_gap_pp: 4.6\n166\t    bootstrap_ci_95: '[-2.1%, 11.3%]'\n167\t    bootstrap_significant: false\n168\t    positive_iterations_of_100: 88\n169\t    sample_size_ja: 680\n170\t    conflictqa_ja_coverage: 0.68\n171\t  result_rationale: 'JA 预测结果弱于 ZH 有三个原因: (1) ConflictQA 中 JA 实体覆盖率低于 ZH（Wikidata\n172\t\n173\t    JA 标签覆盖不如 ZH），可用样本 ~680 vs ZH ~1000; (2) JA 作为 agglutinative 语言，\n174\t\n175\t    tokenizer 切分更碎片化，信息密度/token 低于 ZH，探针输入质量略降; (3) Llama-3.1 的\n176\t\n177\t    JA 训练数据占比低于 ZH，within-lang acc 偏低。\n178\t\n179\t    不对称性方向一致（JA→EN > EN→JA）因相同锚点机制——英语表征空间主导。gap 4.6pp 略\n180\t\n181\t    小于 ZH 的 7.2pp，可能因 JA-EN typological distance 大于 ZH-EN（JA 是 SOV 语序 +\n182\t\n183\t    agglutinative，ZH 是 SVO + isolating），映射两个方向都更难，压缩了不对称性。\n184\t\n185\t    CI 含零主要因样本量不足 (n=680) 导致 power 严重不足。direction consistency 才是关键。\n186\t\n187\t    这个结果对 H1 vs H2 判别力弱——两个假说都兼容此 pattern。需更多语言对（DE, AR）\n188\t\n189\t    才能有效区分。\n190\t\n191\t    '\n192\t  tables:\n193\t  - caption: EN↔JA probe transfer (Llama-3.1-8B, n=680)\n194\t    columns:\n195\t    - Train→Test\n196\t    - Bal. Acc (%)\n197\t    - 95% CI\n198\t    - Perm. p\n199\t    rows:\n200\t    - - EN→EN\n201\t      - '77.1'\n202\t      - '[74.3, 79.9]'\n203\t      - <0.001\n204\t    - - JA→JA\n205\t      - '67.3'\n206\t      - '[63.5, 71.1]'\n207\t      - <0.001\n208\t    - - EN→JA\n209\t      - '61.2'\n210\t      - '[56.9, 65.5]'\n211\t      - '0.021'\n212\t    - - JA→EN\n213\t      - '65.8'\n214\t      - '[61.6, 70.0]'\n215\t      - '0.002'\n216\t    - - Gap (JA→EN − EN→JA)\n217\t      - '+4.6'\n218\t      - '[-2.1, 11.3]'\n219\t      - —\n220\t  - caption: Cross-language-pair asymmetry comparison\n221\t    columns:\n222\t    - Language Pair\n223\t    - Gap (pp)\n224\t    - 95% CI\n225\t    - n\n226\t    - Direction\n227\t    rows:\n228\t    - - EN↔ZH (Llama)\n229\t      - '7.22'\n230\t      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n231\t      - ~1000\n232\t      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n233\t    - - EN↔JA (Llama)\n234\t      - '4.6'\n235\t      - '[-2.1, 11.3]'\n236\t      - ~680\n237\t      - JA→EN > EN→JA\n238\t  figures_description:\n239\t  - '双语言对不对称性对比: EN↔ZH vs EN↔JA 的 asymmetry gap + CI，标注语言对 typological distance (WALS\n240\t    features)。Direction 一致但 gap 可能因 typological distance 或 sample size 差异——无法区分。'\n241\t  analysis: 'EN↔JA 方向一致支持 H1 的 English-anchored 假设——不管目标语言是 ZH 还是 JA，\n242\t\n243\t    X→EN 迁移都优于 EN→X。但 gap 差异 (7.2 vs 4.6pp) 的解释有混淆: 可能是\n244\t\n245\t    typological distance 效应 (支持 H2 的弱形式) 或纯粹是 sample size/coverage 导致的\n246\t\n247\t    power 差异。此实验为 \"方向一致但样本量不足以单独显著\" 的典型 median-tier 结果。\n248\t\n249\t    论文中作为 supplementary evidence 放 Discussion，不宜作为独立 claim。\n250\t\n251\t    贡献: 将 lang_pairs_validated 从 1 提升到 2，满足 RC4 的最低要求。\n252\t\n253\t    '\n254\t- name: Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA\n255\t  plan_id: plan_104\n256\t  description: 逐层 CKA + SVCCA 分析 EN vs ZH 表征相似度变化，对接 language transition 文献\n257\t  expected_results:\n258\t    cka_early_layers_0_to_25pct: 0.92\n259\t    cka_mid_layers_25_to_60pct: 0.78\n260\t    cka_upper_layers_60_to_85pct: 0.71\n261\t    cka_final_layers_85_to_100pct: 0.63\n262\t    svcca_correlation_with_cka: 0.94\n263\t    language_transition_onset_layer_pct: 0.55\n264\t    probe_peak_vs_cka_drop_correlation: -0.67\n265\t    cka_conflict_vs_nonconflict_diff_peak_layer: 0.08\n266\t  result_rationale: 'CKA 从 early layers (~0.92) 单调下降到 final layers (~0.63) 符合 \"Lost\n267\t    in\n268\t\n269\t    Multilinguality\" (Wendler et al. 2024) 的 language transition 预测: 模型在 mid-upper\n270\t\n271\t    layers 开始将 language-universal 语义表征转换为 language-specific 输出表征。\n272\t\n273\t    transition onset ~55% depth 与 Wendler 的 60% 接近（Wendler 用更大模型，transition\n274\t\n275\t    更靠后）。probe accuracy peak 出现在 CKA 开始快速下降的区域——这是核心发现:\n276\t\n277\t    冲突信号在语言表征开始分化的 \"临界层\" 最强，暗示冲突检测发生在 universal→specific\n278\t\n279\t    transition 过程中。但 conflict vs non-conflict 的 CKA 差异仅 0.08（peak 层），\n280\t\n281\t    不够大到支持强结论。SVCCA 与 CKA 高度一致 (r=0.94) 增加方法鲁棒性。\n282\t\n283\t    此实验提供 C4 (layer structure) 的核心证据，但 peak 层跨模型不一致 (Llama 88%,\n284\t\n285\t    Qwen 67%, Gemma 72%) 使得 \"universal pattern\" claim 困难。\n286\t\n287\t    '\n288\t  tables:\n289\t  - caption: Layer-wise CKA between EN and ZH conflict activations (Llama-3.1-8B)\n290\t    columns:\n291\t    - Layer Range\n292\t    - Depth %\n293\t    - CKA (mean)\n294\t    - CKA (std)\n295\t    - Probe Acc (%)\n296\t    rows:\n297\t    - - 0-8\n298\t      - 0-25%\n299\t      - '0.92'\n300\t      - '0.03'\n301\t      - '54.2'\n302\t    - - 8-19\n303\t      - 25-60%\n304\t      - '0.78'\n305\t      - '0.05'\n306\t      - '62.8'\n307\t    - - 19-27\n308\t      - 60-85%\n309\t      - '0.71'\n310\t      - '0.04'\n311\t      - '73.6'\n312\t    - - 27-32\n313\t      - 85-100%\n314\t      - '0.63'\n315\t      - '0.06'\n316\t      - '69.1'\n317\t  - caption: Language transition onset across models\n318\t    columns:\n319\t    - Model\n320\t    - Transition Onset (%)\n321\t    - Probe Peak (%)\n322\t    - CKA at Peak\n323\t    rows:\n324\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n325\t      - 55%\n326\t      - 88%\n327\t      - '0.64'\n328\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n329\t      - 50%\n330\t      - 67%\n331\t      - '0.73'\n332\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n333\t      - 52%\n334\t      - 72%\n335\t      - '0.70'\n336\t  figures_description:\n337\t  - '双 Y 轴折线图: X 轴为层 index (normalized 0-100%)，左 Y 轴为 CKA (EN vs ZH)，右 Y 轴为 probe\n338\t    balanced accuracy。两条线交叉的区域标注为 ''conflict detection zone''。三模型 subplot 横向排列。'\n339\t  - 'CKA heatmap: layer × layer 的 EN-ZH CKA 矩阵，对角线为同层 CKA (上述折线)，off-diagonal 显示跨层对齐——若\n340\t    off-diagonal 有高 CKA 带，暗示 EN 和 ZH 在不同层达到相似表征。'\n341\t  analysis: 'CKA 下降曲线 + probe peak 的共现为 C4 提供了 mechanistic 叙事: \"冲突信号在语言表征\n342\t\n343\t    从 universal 向 specific 转变的过程中达到峰值\"。但三模型 peak 层分散 (67-88%)\n344\t\n345\t    削弱了 \"固定比例\" 的 claim。改为: \"conflict detection peaks during the language\n346\t\n347\t    transition window, whose exact location is architecture-dependent\"。\n348\t\n349\t    CKA conflict vs non-conflict 差异 (0.08) 太小，不支持 \"冲突改变了跨语言对齐\" 这种\n350\t\n351\t    强 claim。应限定为描述性发现。此实验是论文 Section 4.3 的核心图表来源。\n352\t\n353\t    '\n354\t- name: Representation steering (干预实验)\n355\t  plan_id: plan_107\n356\t  description: 用探针方向作 steering vector 干预残差流，测量模型输出的因果变化\n357\t  expected_results:\n358\t    steering_method: probe_weight_direction_addition\n359\t    strong_direction_zh_en_flip_rate: 0.34\n360\t    weak_direction_en_zh_flip_rate: 0.18\n361\t    steering_alpha_optimal: 3.5\n362\t    coherence_preservation_rate: 0.72\n363\t    parametric_to_contextual_flip_rate: 0.28\n364\t    contextual_to_parametric_flip_rate: 0.22\n365\t    random_direction_flip_rate: 0.06\n366\t    steering_effect_significant: true\n367\t    steering_effect_size_cohens_d: 0.41\n368\t  result_rationale: 'Probe weight 方向包含冲突检测信号但非纯因果方向——探针学到的是 \"与冲突相关的方差方向\"\n369\t\n370\t    而非 \"因果控制冲突解决的方向\"。因此 flip rate 偏低 (~18-34%) 而非理想的 50%+。\n371\t\n372\t    ZH→EN 方向 flip rate (34%) 高于 EN→ZH (18%)，与探针迁移不对称性一致: ZH→EN\n373\t\n374\t    探针捕获了更纯粹的冲突信号，steering 更有效。EN→ZH 方向的非线性成分 (MLP gain)\n375\t\n376\t    意味着线性 steering vector 无法充分捕获该方向的冲突信号。\n377\t\n378\t    alpha=3.5 是 coherence-effectiveness trade-off: 过大导致输出退化 (coherence < 60%),\n379\t\n380\t    过小无效果。random direction control (6% flip) 证明效果非随机。\n381\t\n382\t    Cohen''s d=0.41 (medium) 提供 \"correlational evidence consistent with causal role\"\n383\t\n384\t    但不是 clean causal demonstration (那需要 activation patching 或 DAS)。\n385\t\n386\t    此实验在 Track 3 缺席时成为 RC8 的唯一因果证据来源。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t  tables:\n390\t  - caption: Steering intervention results (Llama-3.1-8B, best layer)\n391\t    columns:\n392\t    - Condition\n393\t    - Flip Rate (%)\n394\t    - Coherence (%)\n395\t    - Random Ctrl (%)\n396\t    rows:\n397\t    - - ZH→EN probe direction\n398\t      - '34.2'\n399\t      - '74.1'\n400\t      - '5.8'\n401\t    - - EN→ZH probe direction\n402\t      - '18.1'\n403\t      - '71.3'\n404\t      - '6.2'\n405\t    - - Averaged probe direction\n406\t      - '26.5'\n407\t      - '72.8'\n408\t      - '6.0'\n409\t    - - Random orthogonal direction\n410\t      - '6.0'\n411\t      - '89.5'\n412\t      - —\n413\t  - caption: Steering alpha sensitivity (ZH→EN direction)\n414\t    columns:\n415\t    - Alpha\n416\t    - Flip Rate (%)\n417\t    - Coherence (%)\n418\t    - Net Useful Flips (%)\n419\t    rows:\n420\t    - - '1.0'\n421\t      - '12.3'\n422\t      - '91.2'\n423\t      - '11.2'\n424\t    - - '2.0'\n425\t      - '22.8'\n426\t      - '84.6'\n427\t      - '19.3'\n428\t    - - '3.5'\n429\t      - '34.2'\n430\t      - '74.1'\n431\t      - '25.3'\n432\t    - - '5.0'\n433\t      - '38.9'\n434\t      - '58.3'\n435\t      - '22.7'\n436\t    - - '7.0'\n437\t      - '41.2'\n438\t      - '42.1'\n439\t      - '17.3'\n440\t  figures_description:\n441\t  - Flip rate vs alpha 曲线 + coherence vs alpha 曲线 (双 Y 轴)，标注最优 alpha=3.5 为 net useful\n442\t    flips 最大值。与 random direction baseline 的阴影区域形成对比。\n443\t  - '输出示例表: 3-4 个 steering 前后的 QA 对比，展示 parametric→contextual flip 和 coherence 保持的\n444\t    case。'\n445\t  analysis: 'Steering 提供了有限但实在的因果证据: probe direction 操纵可改变输出，且效果与\n446\t\n447\t    random direction 显著不同 (p<0.001)。但 34% flip rate 不足以声称 \"冲突信号因果\n448\t\n449\t    控制冲突解决\"——更准确的 framing 是 \"探针捕获的方向与冲突解决机制相关联\"。\n450\t\n451\t    论文中放在 Discussion 的 \"Towards Causal Understanding\" 小节，明确 limitation:\n452\t\n453\t    \"Our steering results provide correlational evidence consistent with a causal\n454\t    role\n455\t\n456\t    for the detected conflict signal. Definitive causal claims require activation\n457\t\n458\t    patching or distributed alignment search, which we leave to future work.\"\n459\t\n460\t    不对称 flip rate (34 vs 18%) 与探针不对称性 echo，strengthens C2 narrative。\n461\t\n462\t    '\n463\t- name: 探针权重可视化 + PCA\n464\t  plan_id: plan_109\n465\t  description: 最优层探针权重 PCA/t-SNE 可视化，展示冲突 vs 非冲突的表征分布\n466\t  expected_results:\n467\t    pca_variance_explained_2d: 0.23\n468\t    conflict_nonconflict_cluster_silhouette: 0.31\n469\t    en_zh_overlap_coefficient_mid_layer: 0.62\n470\t    en_zh_overlap_coefficient_late_layer: 0.41\n471\t    cross_lingual_centroid_distance_mid: 1.24\n472\t    cross_lingual_centroid_distance_late: 2.08\n473\t  result_rationale: '前 2 PC 仅解释 23% 方差——高维表征在低维投影中信息丢失严重，这是 known limitation。\n474\t\n475\t    Silhouette 0.31 (weak clustering) 意味着 conflict vs non-conflict 不是 clean 分离\n476\t\n477\t    而是有 substantial overlap，符合 balanced accuracy ~75% (非 95%+) 的预期。\n478\t\n479\t    关键定性发现: mid-layer 中 EN 和 ZH conflict 点云的重叠 (overlap=0.62) 显著高于\n480\t\n481\t    late-layer (0.41)——支持 H1 的 \"mid-layer 共享表征\" 假设。EN conflict 和 ZH\n482\t\n483\t    conflict 的 centroid distance 从 mid (1.24) 到 late (2.08) 增大，与 CKA 下降一致。\n484\t\n485\t    但这是低维投影的定性证据，不能独立支持 claim。作为 Figure 3 (illustrative) 使用。\n486\t\n487\t    '\n488\t  tables:\n489\t  - caption: PCA cluster metrics across layers\n490\t    columns:\n491\t    - Layer\n492\t    - Depth %\n493\t    - Silhouette\n494\t    - EN-ZH Overlap\n495\t    - Centroid Dist.\n496\t    rows:\n497\t    - - Layer 10\n498\t      - 31%\n499\t      - '0.18'\n500\t      - '0.78'\n501\t      - '0.82'\n502\t    - - Layer 18\n503\t      - 56%\n504\t      - '0.28'\n505\t      - '0.62'\n506\t      - '1.24'\n507\t    - - Layer 25\n508\t      - 78%\n509\t      - '0.31'\n510\t      - '0.48'\n511\t      - '1.73'\n512\t    - - Layer 28\n513\t      - 88%\n514\t      - '0.34'\n515\t      - '0.41'\n516\t      - '2.08'\n517\t  figures_description:\n518\t  - '2×2 subplot PCA scatter: mid-layer (layer 18) vs late-layer (layer 28) × Llama\n519\t    vs Qwen。颜色编码: EN-conflict (红), EN-no-conflict (浅红), ZH-conflict (蓝), ZH-no-conflict\n520\t    (浅蓝)。Mid-layer 红蓝 conflict 点云明显重叠; late-layer 按语言分离但 conflict label 仍有区分。'\n521\t  - t-SNE 版本作为 supplementary figure，perplexity=30。与 PCA 定性一致但 cluster 更 visually separated\n522\t    (t-SNE 的已知 artifact，论文中说明)。\n523\t  analysis: 'PCA 可视化的价值是 illustrative 而非 evidentiary。主要功能: (1) 直觉展示 \"冲突信号\n524\t\n525\t    为什么能跨语言迁移\"——mid-layer 两种语言的 conflict 表征在同一区域; (2) 直觉展示\n526\t\n527\t    \"为什么迁移不完美\"——overlap 不是 100%。不应过度解读 silhouette 值。\n528\t\n529\t    放在论文 Figure 3，caption 明确标注 \"illustrative; quantitative analysis in Table 2\"。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: Label noise ablation\n533\t  plan_id: plan_106\n534\t  description: 注入 5-20% label noise 评估探针对 verification pipeline 标注错误的鲁棒性\n535\t  expected_results:\n536\t    noise_0pct_acc: 0.771\n537\t    noise_5pct_acc: 0.758\n538\t    noise_10pct_acc: 0.738\n539\t    noise_15pct_acc: 0.704\n540\t    noise_20pct_acc: 0.668\n541\t    degradation_5pct_pp: -1.3\n542\t    degradation_10pct_pp: -3.3\n543\t    degradation_15pct_pp: -6.7\n544\t    degradation_20pct_pp: -10.3\n545\t    estimated_pipeline_error_rate: 0.04\n546\t    noise_tolerance_threshold: 0.1\n547\t  result_rationale: '探针在 0-10% noise 下温和退化（-1 到 -3pp），10-20% 区间加速退化——典型的线性探针\n548\t\n549\t    noise sensitivity 曲线。此 pattern 因线性模型对 label noise 的 theoretical\n550\t\n551\t    robustness: 当 noise 远低于 signal (acc >> 50%), label flips 对决策边界影响被多数\n552\t\n553\t    正确样本 \"稀释\"。但超过 ~10% 后 signal-to-noise 下降导致边界显著偏移。\n554\t\n555\t    verification pipeline (ConflictQA 的 parametric/contextual answer 匹配) 的估计\n556\t\n557\t    error rate ~4%，远低于 10% tolerance threshold。这证明 C1 的探针 accuracy 不是\n558\t\n559\t    label noise 的 artifact。补充 Appendix A 的 robustness 证据。\n560\t\n561\t    '\n562\t  tables:\n563\t  - caption: Probe accuracy under systematic label noise (Llama-3.1-8B, EN→EN)\n564\t    columns:\n565\t    - Noise Rate\n566\t    - Bal. Acc (%)\n567\t    - Delta (pp)\n568\t    - 95% CI\n569\t    rows:\n570\t    - - 0%\n571\t      - '77.1'\n572\t      - —\n573\t      - '[74.3, 79.9]'\n574\t    - - 5%\n575\t      - '75.8'\n576\t      - '-1.3'\n577\t      - '[72.9, 78.7]'\n578\t    - - 10%\n579\t      - '73.8'\n580\t      - '-3.3'\n581\t      - '[70.7, 76.9]'\n582\t    - - 15%\n583\t      - '70.4'\n584\t      - '-6.7'\n585\t      - '[67.0, 73.8]'\n586\t    - - 20%\n587\t      - '66.8'\n588\t      - '-10.3'\n589\t      - '[63.1, 70.5]'\n590\t  figures_description:\n591\t  - '折线图: X 轴 noise rate (0-20%), Y 轴 balanced accuracy。阴影区域为 95% CI (n=100 bootstrap\n592\t    per noise level)。水平虚线标注 chance level (50%)。垂直虚线标注 estimated pipeline error rate\n593\t    (4%)。'\n594\t  analysis: 'Pipeline error rate 4% 处的 accuracy 损失仅 ~1pp，远小于 CI 宽度——label noise\n595\t\n596\t    对结论无实质影响。此实验直接回应 \"你的 verification pipeline 可能有错\" 的 reviewer\n597\t\n598\t    concern，以实验代替争论。放 Appendix，一图一表足够。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t- name: 更大数据集验证\n602\t  plan_id: plan_108\n603\t  description: 扩大到 2000+ samples 或引入额外数据集验证 C1\n604\t  expected_results:\n605\t    expanded_sample_size: 1800\n606\t    expansion_method: ConflictQA additional sampling + ParaRel-conflict subset\n607\t    en_en_acc_expanded: 0.765\n608\t    asymmetry_gap_pp_expanded: 7.0\n609\t    ci_width_reduction_pct: 35\n610\t    bootstrap_ci_expanded: '[2.3%, 11.7%]'\n611\t    bootstrap_significant_expanded: true\n612\t    new_dataset_consistency: 0.92\n613\t  result_rationale: '样本量从 ~1000 扩至 ~1800 (1.8x) 使 CI 宽度缩减约 35% (sqrt(1.8) ≈ 1.34 倍\n614\t\n615\t    precision)。在 Llama 上，这足以将 borderline significant CI [1.1, 13.6] 收紧为\n616\t\n617\t    [2.3, 11.7]——更 comfortably 排除零。但 Qwen 可能仍含零 (从 [-1.2, 13.4] 到\n618\t\n619\t    [-0.2, 12.5] 左右)。within-lang accuracy 略降 (77.1→76.5) 因新增样本包含更多\n620\t\n621\t    \"difficult\" cases (ConflictQA 的 easy cases 先被采样)。\n622\t\n623\t    ParaRel-conflict subset 与 ConflictQA 的一致性 0.92 (探针在两个数据集的准确率\n624\t\n625\t    高度相关) 增加 ecological validity。但此实验 P1 优先级在 median tier 下可能\n626\t\n627\t    不完整——若只完成 ConflictQA 扩展 (n=1500) 而没做 ParaRel，仍有价值但有限。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t  tables:\n631\t  - caption: Dataset expansion effect on asymmetry CI (Llama-3.1-8B)\n632\t    columns:\n633\t    - Dataset\n634\t    - n\n635\t    - Gap (pp)\n636\t    - 95% CI\n637\t    - Significant?\n638\t    rows:\n639\t    - - ConflictQA original\n640\t      - ~1000\n641\t      - '7.22'\n642\t      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n643\t      - Yes (borderline)\n644\t    - - ConflictQA expanded\n645\t      - ~1500\n646\t      - '7.0'\n647\t      - '[1.8, 12.2]'\n648\t      - 'Yes'\n649\t    - - + ParaRel subset\n650\t      - ~1800\n651\t      - '7.0'\n652\t      - '[2.3, 11.7]'\n653\t      - 'Yes'\n654\t  figures_description:\n655\t  - 'CI 收敛图: X 轴为 sample size (incremental)，Y 轴为 asymmetry gap CI 宽度。Random subsample\n656\t    bootstrap (n=500, 750, 1000, 1250, 1500, 1800) 展示 CI 随 sample size 的收敛速度。'\n657\t  analysis: '主要价值: 将 Llama 从 borderline significant 提升为 comfortably significant，\n658\t\n659\t    增强 C2 的统计基础。但如果 Qwen 仍不显著，核心叙事不变——仍是 \"consistent effect\n660\t\n661\t    size, varying power\"。此实验是 \"nice to have\" 而非 game-changer。\n662\t\n663\t    若时间紧张，优先做 plan_102 (第三模型) 和 plan_107 (steering) 而非此项。\n664\t\n665\t    '\n666\t- name: Qwen-Scope SAE 冲突特征识别\n667\t  plan_id: plan_201\n668\t  description: 用 Qwen-Scope 预训练 SAE 分析冲突激活的差异化特征\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    sae_model: Qwen-Scope (Qwen3-8B-Base)\n671\t    total_sae_features: 65536\n672\t    conflict_activated_features_top: 280\n673\t    mi_selected_features: 45\n674\t    mi_threshold: 0.15\n675\t    top_feature_activation_diff: 2.3\n676\t    feature_interpretability_rate: 0.35\n677\t    cross_lingual_overlap_top_features: 8\n678\t    noise_level: high\n679\t    base_instruct_mismatch_cosine: 0.71\n680\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model，用于 instruct model 分析存在分布偏移 (RC6)。\n681\t\n682\t    Base-instruct cosine similarity ~0.71 意味着约 30% 的激活模式不对齐，导致 SAE\n683\t\n684\t    reconstruction quality 下降，特征识别 noisy。MI-selected 45 个特征中，手动检查\n685\t\n686\t    可解释的仅 35% (其余激活模式无法对应到 human-interpretable concept)。\n687\t\n688\t    conflict-activated 特征数 (280) 远多于预期——许多是 false positive，因 base/instruct\n689\t\n690\t    mismatch 导致 SAE 将 instruct-specific pattern 误解码为多个稀疏特征。\n691\t\n692\t    EN 和 ZH 的 top MI features 重叠仅 8 个 (8/45 ≈ 18%)，初步看似支持 H2\n693\t\n694\t    (language-specific)，但更可能是 noise + mismatch artifact。此结果在 median tier\n695\t\n696\t    属于 \"results noisy\" 范畴，不足以支持 C5 claim。\n697\t\n698\t    '\n699\t  tables:\n700\t  - caption: SAE conflict feature statistics (Qwen-Scope, layer 22)\n701\t    columns:\n702\t    - Metric\n703\t    - EN\n704\t    - ZH\n705\t    - Overlap\n706\t    rows:\n707\t    - - Activated features (>2σ)\n708\t      - '312'\n709\t      - '256'\n710\t      - '78'\n711\t    - - MI-selected (>0.15)\n712\t      - '45'\n713\t      - '42'\n714\t      - '8'\n715\t    - - Interpretable (manual)\n716\t      - 16/45\n717\t      - 14/42\n718\t      - 3/8\n719\t    - - Mean activation diff (conflict-control)\n720\t      - '2.31'\n721\t      - '1.87'\n722\t      - —\n723\t  figures_description:\n724\t  - '特征激活热力图: top-20 MI features × 样本 (conflict/control × EN/ZH)。大量噪声使 pattern 不清晰——作为\n725\t    ''noisy result'' 的 honest report。'\n726\t  analysis: 'Track 2 在 median tier 下产出 noisy 但非完全无用的结果。关键判断: base/instruct\n727\t\n728\t    mismatch 是主要 noise 来源而非冲突信号不存在。论文中可报告为:\n729\t\n730\t    \"Preliminary SAE analysis using Qwen-Scope identified candidate conflict features,\n731\t\n732\t    but the base-instruct distribution shift (cosine similarity 0.71) introduced\n733\t\n734\t    substantial noise. We report these results in Appendix B with the caveat that\n735\t\n736\t    SAE analysis on matched base-model activations is needed for definitive conclusions.\"\n737\t\n738\t    此实验本身成为 Track 2 的 \"learned limitation\"——方法论贡献。\n739\t\n740\t    '\n741\t- name: LangFIR 语言特征解耦\n742\t  plan_id: plan_202\n743\t  description: LangFIR random-token filtering 识别 language-identity 特征并从 conflict features\n744\t    中排除\n745\t  expected_results:\n746\t    langfir_language_features_identified: 120\n747\t    conflict_language_overlap: 22\n748\t    overlap_rate: 0.49\n749\t    residual_conflict_features_after_filtering: 23\n750\t    residual_cross_lingual_overlap: 3\n751\t    residual_interpretability: 0.22\n752\t  result_rationale: 'LangFIR 能较 robustly 地识别 language-identity 特征（random token 下仍激活的\n753\t\n754\t    特征 → language encoding），但当 SAE 本身 noisy (plan_201) 时，conflict features\n755\t\n756\t    和 language features 的 overlap 判定不可靠。overlap_rate 0.49 暗示约半数 \"conflict\n757\t\n758\t    features\" 实际是 language features 被误标——进一步证实 plan_201 的 noise 问题。\n759\t\n760\t    filtering 后剩余 23 个 conflict features 中跨语言重叠仅 3 个，可解释性更低 (22%)。\n761\t\n762\t    此结果不足以支持 \"conflict 和 language 特征可解耦\" 的 C5 子 claim。\n763\t\n764\t    在 median tier 下，此实验更多暴露了 base/instruct mismatch 的下游影响。\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  tables:\n768\t  - caption: LangFIR conflict-language feature decomposition\n769\t    columns:\n770\t    - Category\n771\t    - Count\n772\t    - Cross-lingual Overlap\n773\t    - Interpretable\n774\t    rows:\n775\t    - - All MI-selected conflict features\n776\t      - '45'\n777\t      - 8 (18%)\n778\t      - 16 (36%)\n779\t    - - Language-identity features (LangFIR)\n780\t      - '120'\n781\t      - —\n782\t      - —\n783\t    - - Conflict ∩ Language\n784\t      - '22'\n785\t      - —\n786\t      - —\n787\t    - - Residual conflict (post-filter)\n788\t      - '23'\n789\t      - 3 (13%)\n790\t      - 5 (22%)\n791\t  figures_description:\n792\t  - 'Venn diagram: conflict features vs language features，标注 overlap 和 residual counts。附注\n793\t    base/instruct mismatch caveat。'\n794\t  analysis: '实验执行完整但结论受限于上游 SAE noise。不作为论文 main body 内容。\n795\t\n796\t    若包含，放 Appendix B 作为 \"preliminary investigation\" 连同 plan_201 一起报告。\n797\t\n798\t    关键 takeaway 写入 future work: \"SAE analysis on base-model activations with\n799\t\n800\t    matched training distribution is a critical next step.\"\n801\t\n802\t    '\n803\t- name: Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析\n804\t  plan_id: plan_203\n805\t  description: 计算 mid vs late layer conflict feature 的跨语言 Jaccard 以检验 H1 vs H2\n806\t  expected_results:\n807\t    jaccard_mid_layer: 0.06\n808\t    jaccard_late_layer: 0.04\n809\t    jaccard_diff: 0.02\n810\t    permutation_p_mid_vs_late: 0.38\n811\t    h1_supported: inconclusive\n812\t    h2_supported: inconclusive\n813\t  result_rationale: '在 median tier 下 Jaccard < 0.10 是核心假设。mid-layer 0.06 vs late-layer\n814\t    0.04\n815\t\n816\t    方向上支持 H1 (mid > late) 但差异极小且不显著 (p=0.38)。这是 plan_201 的 noise\n817\t\n818\t    传播的必然结果: 当 individual feature 识别不可靠时，feature 间的 overlap 计算\n819\t\n820\t    更不可靠。两个很小的 noisy set 的 Jaccard 天然趋近零。\n821\t\n822\t    此结果不支持也不反驳 H1 或 H2——是 \"inconclusive\" 而非 \"negative\"。区别重要:\n823\t\n824\t    negative result 意味着 \"我们有 power 检测差异但没发现\"；inconclusive 意味着\n825\t\n826\t    \"我们的工具精度不足以检验此假设\"。\n827\t\n828\t    '\n829\t  tables:\n830\t  - caption: Cross-lingual conflict feature Jaccard by layer group\n831\t    columns:\n832\t    - Layer Group\n833\t    - Depth %\n834\t    - EN features\n835\t    - ZH features\n836\t    - Jaccard\n837\t    - Perm. p\n838\t    rows:\n839\t    - - Mid (layers 10-18)\n840\t      - 31-56%\n841\t      - '38'\n842\t      - '32'\n843\t      - '0.06'\n844\t      - —\n845\t    - - Late (layers 25-30)\n846\t      - 78-94%\n847\t      - '28'\n848\t      - '24'\n849\t      - '0.04'\n850\t      - —\n851\t    - - Mid − Late diff\n852\t      - —\n853\t      - —\n854\t      - —\n855\t      - '+0.02'\n856\t      - '0.38'\n857\t  figures_description:\n858\t  - 'Jaccard by layer 折线图: X 轴为层，Y 轴为 per-layer Jaccard。大量波动，无清晰 trend。灰色阴影为 permutation\n859\t    null distribution。标题注明 inconclusive。'\n860\t  analysis: 'Track 2 三个实验 (201→202→203) 的级联结果: 上游 noise 使最终 H1/H2 检验无效。\n861\t\n862\t    这不是 failure——是 honest methodology boundary。论文 Discussion 中写:\n863\t\n864\t    \"Our SAE-based analysis was limited by the base-instruct distribution mismatch\n865\t\n866\t    (Section B.1). The near-zero Jaccard indices reflect measurement noise rather\n867\t\n868\t    than genuine absence of cross-lingual feature sharing. We consider SAE analysis\n869\t\n870\t    with matched training distributions a high-priority direction for future work.\"\n871\t\n872\t    Track 2 整体作为 Appendix B (2-3 pages)，emphasize method + limitation > results。\n873\t\n874\t    '\n875\t- name: Monolingual→cross-lingual steering transfer\n876\t  plan_id: plan_301\n877\t  description: 用 SpARE 的英语冲突特征做 cross-lingual steering\n878\t  expected_results:\n879\t    status: not_executed\n880\t    reason: depends on plan_201 + plan_203; Track 2 results too noisy to select reliable\n881\t      steering features\n882\t  result_rationale: 'Track 3 依赖 Track 2 提供的 SAE conflict features 作为 steering targets。\n883\t\n884\t    Plan_201 的 noisy results 意味着无法可靠选择 steering features——用 noise-dominated\n885\t\n886\t    features 做 steering 实验会产出 uninterpretable 结果。在 median tier 下\n887\t\n888\t    tracks_submission_ready = 1 (仅 Track 1)，Track 3 不执行是正确决策。\n889\t\n890\t    plan_107 (representation steering using probe weights) 作为替代提供有限因果证据。\n891\t\n892\t    '\n893\t  tables: []\n894\t  figures_description: []\n895\t  analysis: 'Track 3 不执行。论文 Section 6 (Discussion) 标注:\n896\t\n897\t    \"Track 3 steering experiments were deferred due to limitations in SAE feature\n898\t\n899\t    identification (Appendix B). Probe-based representation steering (Section 4.4)\n900\t\n901\t    provides preliminary causal evidence. Full SAE-based steering across language\n902\t\n903\t    pairs remains an important direction for future work.\"\n904\t\n905\t    '\n906\t- name: Cross-lingual-specific steering\n907\t  plan_id: plan_302\n908\t  description: 用跨语言特有特征构建 steering vectors 并与 monolingual 对比\n909\t  expected_results:\n910\t    status: not_executed\n911\t    reason: depends on plan_301 which is not executed\n912\t  result_rationale: 'Plan_302 依赖 plan_301 的 monolingual steering 基线。级联未执行。\n913\t\n914\t    '\n915\t  tables: []\n916\t  figures_description: []\n917\t  analysis: 同 plan_301。Track 3 整体 deferred to future work。\n918\t- name: Typological steering correlation\n919\t  plan_id: plan_303\n920\t  description: Steering 有效性与 CLEAR linguistic similarity metric 的相关性\n921\t  expected_results:\n922\t    status: not_executed\n923\t    reason: depends on plan_301 + plan_103; neither fully available\n924\t  result_rationale: '即使 plan_103 (EN↔JA) 完成，plan_301 未执行意味着无 steering effectiveness\n925\t\n926\t    数据可与 linguistic similarity 做相关分析。此实验是 \"CLEAR 因果链接\" 的最终拼图，\n927\t\n928\t    在 median tier 下明确归入 future work。\n929\t\n930\t    替代叙事: plan_103 的 probe transfer asymmetry 跨语言对的 pattern (EN↔ZH vs\n931\t\n932\t    EN↔JA) 提供 \"correlational hint\"——如果两个语言对的 gap 与 typological distance\n933\t\n934\t    弱相关，可在 Discussion 中提及但不作为 claim。\n935\t\n936\t    '\n937\t  tables: []\n938\t  figures_description: []\n939\t  analysis: 'Track 3 三个实验均 deferred。论文中 Track 3 仅作为 \"planned future work\" 出现在\n940\t\n941\t    Section 6.2 (Future Directions)，与 \"custom SAE training on matched distributions\"\n942\t\n943\t    并列为两大 follow-up 方向。这不损害 ICLR 投稿——现象发现 + 方法论贡献 + honest\n944\t\n945\t    boundary delineation 是 reviewer 尊重的 pattern。'\n946\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"347907fb-725a-460a-a196-d1b396a4fd53","uuid":"dfecdf22-e17b-4df8-be8d-fc3aa11a80e6","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:19:24.688Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod42/projects/clkc_mech_interp/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T023801/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C2 从 \"significant asymmetry\" 调整为 \"remarkably consistent effect\n  size across architectures\n\n  (6.6±0.9pp) despite varying statistical power\"——强调 effect size stability 而非 p-value。\n\n  引用 Cumming (2014) \"new statistics\" 框架: effect size + CI 优于 NHST。\n\n  C1 (detectability) 升级为主 claim，C2 降为 strong supporting evidence。\n\n  Track 1 only 的贡献靠深度弥补: layer-wise 分析 + confound exclusion pipeline (token overlap\n  +\n\n  COMET ablation) 作为方法论贡献。RC8 明确限定为 \"correlational evidence consistent with H1\"，\n\n  causal verification 列为 future work。论文定位: phenomenon characterization + methodology，\n\n  仍 ICLR-viable 但需 supplementary experiments 充实 appendix（更多 ablation、error analysis）。\n\n  Track 2 SAE 若完成但 Jaccard < 0.10，可作为 \"negative/inconclusive result\" 放 appendix，\n\n  反而增加诚实度和完整度。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 第三模型架构验证\n  plan_id: plan_102\n  description: 在 Gemma-2-9B-IT 上重复完整探针实验，验证 ~7.2pp 不对称性跨架构一致性\n  expected_results:\n    model: Gemma-2-9B-IT\n    en_en_bal_acc: 0.731\n    zh_zh_bal_acc: 0.694\n    en_zh_bal_acc: 0.641\n    zh_en_bal_acc: 0.695\n    asymmetry_gap_pp: 5.4\n    bootstrap_ci_95: '[-0.8%, 11.6%]'\n    bootstrap_significant: false\n    positive_iterations_of_100: 94\n    permutation_p_en_en: <0.001\n    permutation_p_zh_zh: <0.001\n    permutation_p_en_zh: 0.006\n    permutation_p_zh_en: <0.001\n    best_layer_en: 23\n    best_layer_zh: 20\n    best_layer_depth_pct: 0.72\n    mlp_en_zh_gain_pp: 3.1\n    mlp_zh_en_gain_pp: 0.8\n    token_overlap_jaccard_mean: 0.035\n    token_overlap_correlation_p: 0.31\n  result_rationale: 'Gemma-2-9B-IT 使用 parallel attention + GeGLU，与 Llama (sequential\n    GQA) 和 Qwen\n\n    (sequential GQA + RoPE variant) 架构差异最大。within-lang acc 落在 0.69-0.73 因 Gemma\n\n    多语言训练配比适中（英语占优但中文覆盖不如 Qwen）。不对称性方向一致（ZH→EN > EN→ZH）\n\n    源于相同底层机制——英语作为训练主导语言的表征锚点效应——与架构无关。但 gap 缩小至 5.4pp\n\n    （vs 7.2pp），因 Gemma 的 parallel attention 提供更均匀的跨层信息流动，降低了方向性\n\n    映射难度差异。CI 含零因: (1) 样本量 ~1000 在 5.4pp effect 下 power 不足, (2) Gemma\n\n    的 attention pattern 引入更大 per-sample 方差。94/100 bootstrap 正向但不足以排除零。\n\n    MLP gain +3.1pp 弱方向，介于 Qwen(2.3pp) 和 Llama(4.7pp corrected) 之间。\n\n    best_layer 深度 72% 与 Qwen(67%) 更接近而非 Llama(88%)，暗示峰值层与架构深度分配\n\n    有关而非固定比例——C4 需更多模型确认 pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Gemma-2-9B-IT probe transfer accuracy (balanced accuracy, n=100 bootstrap)\n    columns:\n    - Train→Test\n    - Bal. Acc (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Perm. p\n    rows:\n    - - EN→EN\n      - '73.1'\n      - '[70.2, 76.0]'\n      - <0.001\n    - - ZH→ZH\n      - '69.4'\n      - '[66.3, 72.5]'\n      - <0.001\n    - - EN→ZH\n      - '64.1'\n      - '[59.9, 68.3]'\n      - '0.006'\n    - - ZH→EN\n      - '69.5'\n      - '[65.7, 73.3]'\n      - <0.001\n    - - Gap (ZH→EN − EN→ZH)\n      - '+5.4'\n      - '[-0.8, 11.6]'\n      - —\n  - caption: Cross-architecture asymmetry consistency (all three models)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Significant?\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '7.22'\n      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n      - Yes (borderline)\n      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '7.18'\n      - '[-1.2, 13.4]'\n      - 'No'\n      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - '5.4'\n      - '[-0.8, 11.6]'\n      - 'No'\n      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n    - - Mean ± SD\n      - 6.60 ± 1.04\n      - —\n      - 1/3 sig, 3/3 consistent\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 三模型不对称性 effect size + 95% CI，水平线标注 grand mean 6.6pp。Llama CI 刚好排除零，Qwen/Gemma\n    CI 含零但全部在正方向。右侧标注 consistency: 3/3 direction, 1/3 significance。'\n  - 'Layer-wise probe accuracy heatmap: Gemma 32 层 × 4 方向（EN→EN, ZH→ZH, EN→ZH, ZH→EN），peak\n    层在 depth ~72%，与 Llama(88%)/Qwen(67%) 横向对比。'\n  analysis: '三模型 effect size: 7.22, 7.18, 5.4 → mean=6.60, SD=1.04pp。Cochran''s Q\n    test 跨\n\n    模型一致性 p=0.68（无显著异质性）。Gemma 偏低 1.8pp 可解释为架构效应而非方向不一致。\n\n    关键叙事: \"In all three architectures spanning two distinct design families (GQA vs\n\n    parallel attention), the ZH→EN transfer consistently exceeded EN→ZH, with a pooled\n\n    effect of 6.6pp (range 5.4–7.2). Only Llama reached conventional significance\n\n    (p<0.05), but the I² heterogeneity statistic of 0% and consistent directionality\n\n    across 3/3 models provides stronger evidence than any single p-value.\"\n\n    Cohen''s d range: 0.32-0.48 (small-to-medium)。对 Cumming (2014) framing 足够。\n\n    C2 claim 降级为: \"consistent directional asymmetry with stable effect size\" 而非\n\n    \"statistically significant asymmetry\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 多语言扩展 (EN↔JA)\n  plan_id: plan_103\n  description: 扩展到 EN↔JA 语言对，测试不对称性是否与 typological distance 相关\n  expected_results:\n    model_tested: Llama-3.1-8B (primary) + Qwen3-8B (if time permits)\n    ja_translation_comet_mean: 0.74\n    ja_translation_pass_rate_080: 0.22\n    en_en_bal_acc: 0.771\n    ja_ja_bal_acc: 0.673\n    en_ja_bal_acc: 0.612\n    ja_en_bal_acc: 0.658\n    asymmetry_gap_pp: 4.6\n    bootstrap_ci_95: '[-2.1%, 11.3%]'\n    bootstrap_significant: false\n    positive_iterations_of_100: 88\n    sample_size_ja: 680\n    conflictqa_ja_coverage: 0.68\n  result_rationale: 'JA 预测结果弱于 ZH 有三个原因: (1) ConflictQA 中 JA 实体覆盖率低于 ZH（Wikidata\n\n    JA 标签覆盖不如 ZH），可用样本 ~680 vs ZH ~1000; (2) JA 作为 agglutinative 语言，\n\n    tokenizer 切分更碎片化，信息密度/token 低于 ZH，探针输入质量略降; (3) Llama-3.1 的\n\n    JA 训练数据占比低于 ZH，within-lang acc 偏低。\n\n    不对称性方向一致（JA→EN > EN→JA）因相同锚点机制——英语表征空间主导。gap 4.6pp 略\n\n    小于 ZH 的 7.2pp，可能因 JA-EN typological distance 大于 ZH-EN（JA 是 SOV 语序 +\n\n    agglutinative，ZH 是 SVO + isolating），映射两个方向都更难，压缩了不对称性。\n\n    CI 含零主要因样本量不足 (n=680) 导致 power 严重不足。direction consistency 才是关键。\n\n    这个结果对 H1 vs H2 判别力弱——两个假说都兼容此 pattern。需更多语言对（DE, AR）\n\n    才能有效区分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: EN↔JA probe transfer (Llama-3.1-8B, n=680)\n    columns:\n    - Train→Test\n    - Bal. Acc (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Perm. p\n    rows:\n    - - EN→EN\n      - '77.1'\n      - '[74.3, 79.9]'\n      - <0.001\n    - - JA→JA\n      - '67.3'\n      - '[63.5, 71.1]'\n      - <0.001\n    - - EN→JA\n      - '61.2'\n      - '[56.9, 65.5]'\n      - '0.021'\n    - - JA→EN\n      - '65.8'\n      - '[61.6, 70.0]'\n      - '0.002'\n    - - Gap (JA→EN − EN→JA)\n      - '+4.6'\n      - '[-2.1, 11.3]'\n      - —\n  - caption: Cross-language-pair asymmetry comparison\n    columns:\n    - Language Pair\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - n\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - EN↔ZH (Llama)\n      - '7.22'\n      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n      - ~1000\n      - ZH→EN > EN→ZH\n    - - EN↔JA (Llama)\n      - '4.6'\n      - '[-2.1, 11.3]'\n      - ~680\n      - JA→EN > EN→JA\n  figures_description:\n  - '双语言对不对称性对比: EN↔ZH vs EN↔JA 的 asymmetry gap + CI，标注语言对 typological distance (WALS\n    features)。Direction 一致但 gap 可能因 typological distance 或 sample size 差异——无法区分。'\n  analysis: 'EN↔JA 方向一致支持 H1 的 English-anchored 假设——不管目标语言是 ZH 还是 JA，\n\n    X→EN 迁移都优于 EN→X。但 gap 差异 (7.2 vs 4.6pp) 的解释有混淆: 可能是\n\n    typological distance 效应 (支持 H2 的弱形式) 或纯粹是 sample size/coverage 导致的\n\n    power 差异。此实验为 \"方向一致但样本量不足以单独显著\" 的典型 median-tier 结果。\n\n    论文中作为 supplementary evidence 放 Discussion，不宜作为独立 claim。\n\n    贡献: 将 lang_pairs_validated 从 1 提升到 2，满足 RC4 的最低要求。\n\n    '\n- name: Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA\n  plan_id: plan_104\n  description: 逐层 CKA + SVCCA 分析 EN vs ZH 表征相似度变化，对接 language transition 文献\n  expected_results:\n    cka_early_layers_0_to_25pct: 0.92\n    cka_mid_layers_25_to_60pct: 0.78\n    cka_upper_layers_60_to_85pct: 0.71\n    cka_final_layers_85_to_100pct: 0.63\n    svcca_correlation_with_cka: 0.94\n    language_transition_onset_layer_pct: 0.55\n    probe_peak_vs_cka_drop_correlation: -0.67\n    cka_conflict_vs_nonconflict_diff_peak_layer: 0.08\n  result_rationale: 'CKA 从 early layers (~0.92) 单调下降到 final layers (~0.63) 符合 \"Lost\n    in\n\n    Multilinguality\" (Wendler et al. 2024) 的 language transition 预测: 模型在 mid-upper\n\n    layers 开始将 language-universal 语义表征转换为 language-specific 输出表征。\n\n    transition onset ~55% depth 与 Wendler 的 60% 接近（Wendler 用更大模型，transition\n\n    更靠后）。probe accuracy peak 出现在 CKA 开始快速下降的区域——这是核心发现:\n\n    冲突信号在语言表征开始分化的 \"临界层\" 最强，暗示冲突检测发生在 universal→specific\n\n    transition 过程中。但 conflict vs non-conflict 的 CKA 差异仅 0.08（peak 层），\n\n    不够大到支持强结论。SVCCA 与 CKA 高度一致 (r=0.94) 增加方法鲁棒性。\n\n    此实验提供 C4 (layer structure) 的核心证据，但 peak 层跨模型不一致 (Llama 88%,\n\n    Qwen 67%, Gemma 72%) 使得 \"universal pattern\" claim 困难。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Layer-wise CKA between EN and ZH conflict activations (Llama-3.1-8B)\n    columns:\n    - Layer Range\n    - Depth %\n    - CKA (mean)\n    - CKA (std)\n    - Probe Acc (%)\n    rows:\n    - - 0-8\n      - 0-25%\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '54.2'\n    - - 8-19\n      - 25-60%\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '62.8'\n    - - 19-27\n      - 60-85%\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '73.6'\n    - - 27-32\n      - 85-100%\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.06'\n      - '69.1'\n  - caption: Language transition onset across models\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Transition Onset (%)\n    - Probe Peak (%)\n    - CKA at Peak\n    rows:\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 55%\n      - 88%\n      - '0.64'\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 50%\n      - 67%\n      - '0.73'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 52%\n      - 72%\n      - '0.70'\n  figures_description:\n  - '双 Y 轴折线图: X 轴为层 index (normalized 0-100%)，左 Y 轴为 CKA (EN vs ZH)，右 Y 轴为 probe\n    balanced accuracy。两条线交叉的区域标注为 ''conflict detection zone''。三模型 subplot 横向排列。'\n  - 'CKA heatmap: layer × layer 的 EN-ZH CKA 矩阵，对角线为同层 CKA (上述折线)，off-diagonal 显示跨层对齐——若\n    off-diagonal 有高 CKA 带，暗示 EN 和 ZH 在不同层达到相似表征。'\n  analysis: 'CKA 下降曲线 + probe peak 的共现为 C4 提供了 mechanistic 叙事: \"冲突信号在语言表征\n\n    从 universal 向 specific 转变的过程中达到峰值\"。但三模型 peak 层分散 (67-88%)\n\n    削弱了 \"固定比例\" 的 claim。改为: \"conflict detection peaks during the language\n\n    transition window, whose exact location is architecture-dependent\"。\n\n    CKA conflict vs non-conflict 差异 (0.08) 太小，不支持 \"冲突改变了跨语言对齐\" 这种\n\n    强 claim。应限定为描述性发现。此实验是论文 Section 4.3 的核心图表来源。\n\n    '\n- name: Representation steering (干预实验)\n  plan_id: plan_107\n  description: 用探针方向作 steering vector 干预残差流，测量模型输出的因果变化\n  expected_results:\n    steering_method: probe_weight_direction_addition\n    strong_direction_zh_en_flip_rate: 0.34\n    weak_direction_en_zh_flip_rate: 0.18\n    steering_alpha_optimal: 3.5\n    coherence_preservation_rate: 0.72\n    parametric_to_contextual_flip_rate: 0.28\n    contextual_to_parametric_flip_rate: 0.22\n    random_direction_flip_rate: 0.06\n    steering_effect_significant: true\n    steering_effect_size_cohens_d: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'Probe weight 方向包含冲突检测信号但非纯因果方向——探针学到的是 \"与冲突相关的方差方向\"\n\n    而非 \"因果控制冲突解决的方向\"。因此 flip rate 偏低 (~18-34%) 而非理想的 50%+。\n\n    ZH→EN 方向 flip rate (34%) 高于 EN→ZH (18%)，与探针迁移不对称性一致: ZH→EN\n\n    探针捕获了更纯粹的冲突信号，steering 更有效。EN→ZH 方向的非线性成分 (MLP gain)\n\n    意味着线性 steering vector 无法充分捕获该方向的冲突信号。\n\n    alpha=3.5 是 coherence-effectiveness trade-off: 过大导致输出退化 (coherence < 60%),\n\n    过小无效果。random direction control (6% flip) 证明效果非随机。\n\n    Cohen''s d=0.41 (medium) 提供 \"correlational evidence consistent with causal role\"\n\n    但不是 clean causal demonstration (那需要 activation patching 或 DAS)。\n\n    此实验在 Track 3 缺席时成为 RC8 的唯一因果证据来源。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Steering intervention results (Llama-3.1-8B, best layer)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Flip Rate (%)\n    - Coherence (%)\n    - Random Ctrl (%)\n    rows:\n    - - ZH→EN probe direction\n      - '34.2'\n      - '74.1'\n      - '5.8'\n    - - EN→ZH probe direction\n      - '18.1'\n      - '71.3'\n      - '6.2'\n    - - Averaged probe direction\n      - '26.5'\n      - '72.8'\n      - '6.0'\n    - - Random orthogonal direction\n      - '6.0'\n      - '89.5'\n      - —\n  - caption: Steering alpha sensitivity (ZH→EN direction)\n    columns:\n    - Alpha\n    - Flip Rate (%)\n    - Coherence (%)\n    - Net Useful Flips (%)\n    rows:\n    - - '1.0'\n      - '12.3'\n      - '91.2'\n      - '11.2'\n    - - '2.0'\n      - '22.8'\n      - '84.6'\n      - '19.3'\n    - - '3.5'\n      - '34.2'\n      - '74.1'\n      - '25.3'\n    - - '5.0'\n      - '38.9'\n      - '58.3'\n      - '22.7'\n    - - '7.0'\n      - '41.2'\n      - '42.1'\n      - '17.3'\n  figures_description:\n  - Flip rate vs alpha 曲线 + coherence vs alpha 曲线 (双 Y 轴)，标注最优 alpha=3.5 为 net useful\n    flips 最大值。与 random direction baseline 的阴影区域形成对比。\n  - '输出示例表: 3-4 个 steering 前后的 QA 对比，展示 parametric→contextual flip 和 coherence 保持的\n    case。'\n  analysis: 'Steering 提供了有限但实在的因果证据: probe direction 操纵可改变输出，且效果与\n\n    random direction 显著不同 (p<0.001)。但 34% flip rate 不足以声称 \"冲突信号因果\n\n    控制冲突解决\"——更准确的 framing 是 \"探针捕获的方向与冲突解决机制相关联\"。\n\n    论文中放在 Discussion 的 \"Towards Causal Understanding\" 小节，明确 limitation:\n\n    \"Our steering results provide correlational evidence consistent with a causal\n    role\n\n    for the detected conflict signal. Definitive causal claims require activation\n\n    patching or distributed alignment search, which we leave to future work.\"\n\n    不对称 flip rate (34 vs 18%) 与探针不对称性 echo，strengthens C2 narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: 探针权重可视化 + PCA\n  plan_id: plan_109\n  description: 最优层探针权重 PCA/t-SNE 可视化，展示冲突 vs 非冲突的表征分布\n  expected_results:\n    pca_variance_explained_2d: 0.23\n    conflict_nonconflict_cluster_silhouette: 0.31\n    en_zh_overlap_coefficient_mid_layer: 0.62\n    en_zh_overlap_coefficient_late_layer: 0.41\n    cross_lingual_centroid_distance_mid: 1.24\n    cross_lingual_centroid_distance_late: 2.08\n  result_rationale: '前 2 PC 仅解释 23% 方差——高维表征在低维投影中信息丢失严重，这是 known limitation。\n\n    Silhouette 0.31 (weak clustering) 意味着 conflict vs non-conflict 不是 clean 分离\n\n    而是有 substantial overlap，符合 balanced accuracy ~75% (非 95%+) 的预期。\n\n    关键定性发现: mid-layer 中 EN 和 ZH conflict 点云的重叠 (overlap=0.62) 显著高于\n\n    late-layer (0.41)——支持 H1 的 \"mid-layer 共享表征\" 假设。EN conflict 和 ZH\n\n    conflict 的 centroid distance 从 mid (1.24) 到 late (2.08) 增大，与 CKA 下降一致。\n\n    但这是低维投影的定性证据，不能独立支持 claim。作为 Figure 3 (illustrative) 使用。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: PCA cluster metrics across layers\n    columns:\n    - Layer\n    - Depth %\n    - Silhouette\n    - EN-ZH Overlap\n    - Centroid Dist.\n    rows:\n    - - Layer 10\n      - 31%\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.82'\n    - - Layer 18\n      - 56%\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '1.24'\n    - - Layer 25\n      - 78%\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '1.73'\n    - - Layer 28\n      - 88%\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '2.08'\n  figures_description:\n  - '2×2 subplot PCA scatter: mid-layer (layer 18) vs late-layer (layer 28) × Llama\n    vs Qwen。颜色编码: EN-conflict (红), EN-no-conflict (浅红), ZH-conflict (蓝), ZH-no-conflict\n    (浅蓝)。Mid-layer 红蓝 conflict 点云明显重叠; late-layer 按语言分离但 conflict label 仍有区分。'\n  - t-SNE 版本作为 supplementary figure，perplexity=30。与 PCA 定性一致但 cluster 更 visually separated\n    (t-SNE 的已知 artifact，论文中说明)。\n  analysis: 'PCA 可视化的价值是 illustrative 而非 evidentiary。主要功能: (1) 直觉展示 \"冲突信号\n\n    为什么能跨语言迁移\"——mid-layer 两种语言的 conflict 表征在同一区域; (2) 直觉展示\n\n    \"为什么迁移不完美\"——overlap 不是 100%。不应过度解读 silhouette 值。\n\n    放在论文 Figure 3，caption 明确标注 \"illustrative; quantitative analysis in Table 2\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Label noise ablation\n  plan_id: plan_106\n  description: 注入 5-20% label noise 评估探针对 verification pipeline 标注错误的鲁棒性\n  expected_results:\n    noise_0pct_acc: 0.771\n    noise_5pct_acc: 0.758\n    noise_10pct_acc: 0.738\n    noise_15pct_acc: 0.704\n    noise_20pct_acc: 0.668\n    degradation_5pct_pp: -1.3\n    degradation_10pct_pp: -3.3\n    degradation_15pct_pp: -6.7\n    degradation_20pct_pp: -10.3\n    estimated_pipeline_error_rate: 0.04\n    noise_tolerance_threshold: 0.1\n  result_rationale: '探针在 0-10% noise 下温和退化（-1 到 -3pp），10-20% 区间加速退化——典型的线性探针\n\n    noise sensitivity 曲线。此 pattern 因线性模型对 label noise 的 theoretical\n\n    robustness: 当 noise 远低于 signal (acc >> 50%), label flips 对决策边界影响被多数\n\n    正确样本 \"稀释\"。但超过 ~10% 后 signal-to-noise 下降导致边界显著偏移。\n\n    verification pipeline (ConflictQA 的 parametric/contextual answer 匹配) 的估计\n\n    error rate ~4%，远低于 10% tolerance threshold。这证明 C1 的探针 accuracy 不是\n\n    label noise 的 artifact。补充 Appendix A 的 robustness 证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Probe accuracy under systematic label noise (Llama-3.1-8B, EN→EN)\n    columns:\n    - Noise Rate\n    - Bal. Acc (%)\n    - Delta (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - 0%\n      - '77.1'\n      - —\n      - '[74.3, 79.9]'\n    - - 5%\n      - '75.8'\n      - '-1.3'\n      - '[72.9, 78.7]'\n    - - 10%\n      - '73.8'\n      - '-3.3'\n      - '[70.7, 76.9]'\n    - - 15%\n      - '70.4'\n      - '-6.7'\n      - '[67.0, 73.8]'\n    - - 20%\n      - '66.8'\n      - '-10.3'\n      - '[63.1, 70.5]'\n  figures_description:\n  - '折线图: X 轴 noise rate (0-20%), Y 轴 balanced accuracy。阴影区域为 95% CI (n=100 bootstrap\n    per noise level)。水平虚线标注 chance level (50%)。垂直虚线标注 estimated pipeline error rate\n    (4%)。'\n  analysis: 'Pipeline error rate 4% 处的 accuracy 损失仅 ~1pp，远小于 CI 宽度——label noise\n\n    对结论无实质影响。此实验直接回应 \"你的 verification pipeline 可能有错\" 的 reviewer\n\n    concern，以实验代替争论。放 Appendix，一图一表足够。\n\n    '\n- name: 更大数据集验证\n  plan_id: plan_108\n  description: 扩大到 2000+ samples 或引入额外数据集验证 C1\n  expected_results:\n    expanded_sample_size: 1800\n    expansion_method: ConflictQA additional sampling + ParaRel-conflict subset\n    en_en_acc_expanded: 0.765\n    asymmetry_gap_pp_expanded: 7.0\n    ci_width_reduction_pct: 35\n    bootstrap_ci_expanded: '[2.3%, 11.7%]'\n    bootstrap_significant_expanded: true\n    new_dataset_consistency: 0.92\n  result_rationale: '样本量从 ~1000 扩至 ~1800 (1.8x) 使 CI 宽度缩减约 35% (sqrt(1.8) ≈ 1.34 倍\n\n    precision)。在 Llama 上，这足以将 borderline significant CI [1.1, 13.6] 收紧为\n\n    [2.3, 11.7]——更 comfortably 排除零。但 Qwen 可能仍含零 (从 [-1.2, 13.4] 到\n\n    [-0.2, 12.5] 左右)。within-lang accuracy 略降 (77.1→76.5) 因新增样本包含更多\n\n    \"difficult\" cases (ConflictQA 的 easy cases 先被采样)。\n\n    ParaRel-conflict subset 与 ConflictQA 的一致性 0.92 (探针在两个数据集的准确率\n\n    高度相关) 增加 ecological validity。但此实验 P1 优先级在 median tier 下可能\n\n    不完整——若只完成 ConflictQA 扩展 (n=1500) 而没做 ParaRel，仍有价值但有限。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Dataset expansion effect on asymmetry CI (Llama-3.1-8B)\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - n\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Significant?\n    rows:\n    - - ConflictQA original\n      - ~1000\n      - '7.22'\n      - '[1.1, 13.6]'\n      - Yes (borderline)\n    - - ConflictQA expanded\n      - ~1500\n      - '7.0'\n      - '[1.8, 12.2]'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - + ParaRel subset\n      - ~1800\n      - '7.0'\n      - '[2.3, 11.7]'\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'CI 收敛图: X 轴为 sample size (incremental)，Y 轴为 asymmetry gap CI 宽度。Random subsample\n    bootstrap (n=500, 750, 1000, 1250, 1500, 1800) 展示 CI 随 sample size 的收敛速度。'\n  analysis: '主要价值: 将 Llama 从 borderline significant 提升为 comfortably significant，\n\n    增强 C2 的统计基础。但如果 Qwen 仍不显著，核心叙事不变——仍是 \"consistent effect\n\n    size, varying power\"。此实验是 \"nice to have\" 而非 game-changer。\n\n    若时间紧张，优先做 plan_102 (第三模型) 和 plan_107 (steering) 而非此项。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen-Scope SAE 冲突特征识别\n  plan_id: plan_201\n  description: 用 Qwen-Scope 预训练 SAE 分析冲突激活的差异化特征\n  expected_results:\n    sae_model: Qwen-Scope (Qwen3-8B-Base)\n    total_sae_features: 65536\n    conflict_activated_features_top: 280\n    mi_selected_features: 45\n    mi_threshold: 0.15\n    top_feature_activation_diff: 2.3\n    feature_interpretability_rate: 0.35\n    cross_lingual_overlap_top_features: 8\n    noise_level: high\n    base_instruct_mismatch_cosine: 0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-Scope SAE 训练在 base model，用于 instruct model 分析存在分布偏移 (RC6)。\n\n    Base-instruct cosine similarity ~0.71 意味着约 30% 的激活模式不对齐，导致 SAE\n\n    reconstruction quality 下降，特征识别 noisy。MI-selected 45 个特征中，手动检查\n\n    可解释的仅 35% (其余激活模式无法对应到 human-interpretable concept)。\n\n    conflict-activated 特征数 (280) 远多于预期——许多是 false positive，因 base/instruct\n\n    mismatch 导致 SAE 将 instruct-specific pattern 误解码为多个稀疏特征。\n\n    EN 和 ZH 的 top MI features 重叠仅 8 个 (8/45 ≈ 18%)，初步看似支持 H2\n\n    (language-specific)，但更可能是 noise + mismatch artifact。此结果在 median tier\n\n    属于 \"results noisy\" 范畴，不足以支持 C5 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: SAE conflict feature statistics (Qwen-Scope, layer 22)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - EN\n    - ZH\n    - Overlap\n    rows:\n    - - Activated features (>2σ)\n      - '312'\n      - '256'\n      - '78'\n    - - MI-selected (>0.15)\n      - '45'\n      - '42'\n      - '8'\n    - - Interpretable (manual)\n      - 16/45\n      - 14/42\n      - 3/8\n    - - Mean activation diff (conflict-control)\n      - '2.31'\n      - '1.87'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - '特征激活热力图: top-20 MI features × 样本 (conflict/control × EN/ZH)。大量噪声使 pattern 不清晰——作为\n    ''noisy result'' 的 honest report。'\n  analysis: 'Track 2 在 median tier 下产出 noisy 但非完全无用的结果。关键判断: base/instruct\n\n    mismatch 是主要 noise 来源而非冲突信号不存在。论文中可报告为:\n\n    \"Preliminary SAE analysis using Qwen-Scope identified candidate conflict features,\n\n    but the base-instruct distribution shift (cosine similarity 0.71) introduced\n\n    substantial noise. We report these results in Appendix B with the caveat that\n\n    SAE analysis on matched base-model activations is needed for definitive conclusions.\"\n\n    此实验本身成为 Track 2 的 \"learned limitation\"——方法论贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: LangFIR 语言特征解耦\n  plan_id: plan_202\n  description: LangFIR random-token filtering 识别 language-identity 特征并从 conflict features\n    中排除\n  expected_results:\n    langfir_language_features_identified: 120\n    conflict_language_overlap: 22\n    overlap_rate: 0.49\n    residual_conflict_features_after_filtering: 23\n    residual_cross_lingual_overlap: 3\n    residual_interpretability: 0.22\n  result_rationale: 'LangFIR 能较 robustly 地识别 language-identity 特征（random token 下仍激活的\n\n    特征 → language encoding），但当 SAE 本身 noisy (plan_201) 时，conflict features\n\n    和 language features 的 overlap 判定不可靠。overlap_rate 0.49 暗示约半数 \"conflict\n\n    features\" 实际是 language features 被误标——进一步证实 plan_201 的 noise 问题。\n\n    filtering 后剩余 23 个 conflict features 中跨语言重叠仅 3 个，可解释性更低 (22%)。\n\n    此结果不足以支持 \"conflict 和 language 特征可解耦\" 的 C5 子 claim。\n\n    在 median tier 下，此实验更多暴露了 base/instruct mismatch 的下游影响。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: LangFIR conflict-language feature decomposition\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - Cross-lingual Overlap\n    - Interpretable\n    rows:\n    - - All MI-selected conflict features\n      - '45'\n      - 8 (18%)\n      - 16 (36%)\n    - - Language-identity features (LangFIR)\n      - '120'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Conflict ∩ Language\n      - '22'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Residual conflict (post-filter)\n      - '23'\n      - 3 (13%)\n      - 5 (22%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Venn diagram: conflict features vs language features，标注 overlap 和 residual counts。附注\n    base/instruct mismatch caveat。'\n  analysis: '实验执行完整但结论受限于上游 SAE noise。不作为论文 main body 内容。\n\n    若包含，放 Appendix B 作为 \"preliminary investigation\" 连同 plan_201 一起报告。\n\n    关键 takeaway 写入 future work: \"SAE analysis on base-model activations with\n\n    matched training distribution is a critical next step.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-lingual feature Jaccard 分析\n  plan_id: plan_203\n  description: 计算 mid vs late layer conflict feature 的跨语言 Jaccard 以检验 H1 vs H2\n  expected_results:\n    jaccard_mid_layer: 0.06\n    jaccard_late_layer: 0.04\n    jaccard_diff: 0.02\n    permutation_p_mid_vs_late: 0.38\n    h1_supported: inconclusive\n    h2_supported: inconclusive\n  result_rationale: '在 median tier 下 Jaccard < 0.10 是核心假设。mid-layer 0.06 vs late-layer\n    0.04\n\n    方向上支持 H1 (mid > late) 但差异极小且不显著 (p=0.38)。这是 plan_201 的 noise\n\n    传播的必然结果: 当 individual feature 识别不可靠时，feature 间的 overlap 计算\n\n    更不可靠。两个很小的 noisy set 的 Jaccard 天然趋近零。\n\n    此结果不支持也不反驳 H1 或 H2——是 \"inconclusive\" 而非 \"negative\"。区别重要:\n\n    negative result 意味着 \"我们有 power 检测差异但没发现\"；inconclusive 意味着\n\n    \"我们的工具精度不足以检验此假设\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Cross-lingual conflict feature Jaccard by layer group\n    columns:\n    - Layer Group\n    - Depth %\n    - EN features\n    - ZH features\n    - Jaccard\n    - Perm. p\n    rows:\n    - - Mid (layers 10-18)\n      - 31-56%\n      - '38'\n      - '32'\n      - '0.06'\n      - —\n    - - Late (layers 25-30)\n      - 78-94%\n      - '28'\n      - '24'\n      - '0.04'\n      - —\n    - - Mid − Late diff\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '0.38'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Jaccard by layer 折线图: X 轴为层，Y 轴为 per-layer Jaccard。大量波动，无清晰 trend。灰色阴影为 permutation\n    null distribution。标题注明 inconclusive。'\n  analysis: 'Track 2 三个实验 (201→202→203) 的级联结果: 上游 noise 使最终 H1/H2 检验无效。\n\n    这不是 failure——是 honest methodology boundary。论文 Discussion 中写:\n\n    \"Our SAE-based analysis was limited by the base-instruct distribution mismatch\n\n    (Section B.1). The near-zero Jaccard indices reflect measurement noise rather\n\n    than genuine absence of cross-lingual feature sharing. We consider SAE analysis\n\n    with matched training distributions a high-priority direction for future work.\"\n\n    Track 2 整体作为 Appendix B (2-3 pages)，emphasize method + limitation > results。\n\n    '\n- name: Monolingual→cross-lingual steering transfer\n  plan_id: plan_301\n  description: 用 SpARE 的英语冲突特征做 cross-lingual steering\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: depends on plan_201 + plan_203; Track 2 results too noisy to select reliable\n      steering features\n  result_rationale: 'Track 3 依赖 Track 2 提供的 SAE conflict features 作为 steering targets。\n\n    Plan_201 的 noisy results 意味着无法可靠选择 steering features——用 noise-dominated\n\n    features 做 steering 实验会产出 uninterpretable 结果。在 median tier 下\n\n    tracks_submission_ready = 1 (仅 Track 1)，Track 3 不执行是正确决策。\n\n    plan_107 (representation steering using probe weights) 作为替代提供有限因果证据。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Track 3 不执行。论文 Section 6 (Discussion) 标注:\n\n    \"Track 3 steering experiments were deferred due to limitations in SAE feature\n\n    identification (Appendix B). Probe-based representation steering (Section 4.4)\n\n    provides preliminary causal evidence. Full SAE-based steering across language\n\n    pairs remains an important direction for future work.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-lingual-specific steering\n  plan_id: plan_302\n  description: 用跨语言特有特征构建 steering vectors 并与 monolingual 对比\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: depends on plan_301 which is not executed\n  result_rationale: 'Plan_302 依赖 plan_301 的 monolingual steering 基线。级联未执行。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 同 plan_301。Track 3 整体 deferred to future work。\n- name: Typological steering correlation\n  plan_id: plan_303\n  description: Steering 有效性与 CLEAR linguistic similarity metric 的相关性\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_executed\n    reason: depends on plan_301 + plan_103; neither fully available\n  result_rationale: '即使 plan_103 (EN↔JA) 完成，plan_301 未执行意味着无 steering effectiveness\n\n    数据可与 linguistic similarity 做相关分析。此实验是 \"CLEAR 因果链接\" 的最终拼图，\n\n    在 median tier 下明确归入 future work。\n\n    替代叙事: plan_103 的 probe transfer asymmetry 跨语言对的 pattern (EN↔ZH vs\n\n    EN↔JA) 提供 \"correlational hint\"——如果两个语言对的 gap 与 typological distance\n\n    弱相关，可在 Discussion 中提及但不作为 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Track 3 三个实验均 deferred。论文中 Track 3 仅作为 \"planned future work\" 出现在\n\n    Section 6.2 (Future Directions)，与 \"custom SAE training on matched distributions\"\n\n    并列为两大 follow-up 方向。这不损害 ICLR 投稿——现象发现 + 方法论贡献 + honest\n\n    boundary delineation 是 reviewer 尊重的 pattern。'\n","numLines":946,"startLine":1,"totalLines":946}}}
