{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015KYw5UfuYA7nVN8jWcLzEx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ICLR 2024 reviewer form score rating 1-10\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Insights from the ICLR Peer Review and Rebuttal Process\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.15462\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) Insights from the ICLR Peer Review and Rebuttal Process\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/397780200_Insights_from_the_ICLR_Peer_Review_and_Rebuttal_Process\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2024 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/iclr-statistics/iclr-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"Paper page - Insights from the ICLR Peer Review and Rebuttal Process\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2511.15462\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, the overall rating for ICLR 2024 is a discrete number in {1, 3, 5, 6, 8, 10}. This is not a continuous 1-10 scale, but rather a specific set of six allowed values for reviewer ratings.\n\nAdditionally, numerical scores are provided for soundness, presentation, contribution, confidence, and overall rating in the ICLR 2024 reviewer form.\n\nIt's worth noting that the overall rating for ICLR 2026 is mapped to {0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10}, which differs slightly from the 2024 scale.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013Kgvyzk6NEUhNd7tsGeanW","session_id":"347907fb-725a-460a-a196-d1b396a4fd53","uuid":"d53fa38f-7eaa-43bf-bafc-94a26ba74dac","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:20:23.471Z"}
