{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014r8Q3LJkLJ99Q1iWm47Bro","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Token Overlap Analysis: EN-ZH\n2\t\n3\t**Date**: 2026-05-22\n4\t**Task**: Compute token overlap between EN and ZH prompts for two models\n5\t\n6\t## Data\n7\t\n8\t| Model | EN prompts | ZH prompts | EN files | ZH files |\n9\t|-------|-----------|-----------|----------|----------|\n10\t| Qwen3-8B | 966 | 966 | en_conflict_{train,test}_verified.jsonl | zh_conflict_{train,test}.jsonl |\n11\t| Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct | 1368 | 1368 | en_conflict_{train,test}_verified.jsonl | zh_conflict_{train,test}.jsonl |\n12\t\n13\tPrompt = question + context fields concatenated.\n14\t\n15\t## Results\n16\t\n17\t### Qwen3-8B (vocab size: 151,643)\n18\t\n19\t| Metric | Value |\n20\t|--------|-------|\n21\t| Unique EN token IDs | 13,836 |\n22\t| Unique ZH token IDs | 10,140 |\n23\t| Intersection (EN∩ZH) | 2,264 |\n24\t| Union (EN∪ZH) | 21,712 |\n25\t| **Jaccard** (∩/∪) | **0.1043** |\n26\t| Overlap/EN (∩/EN) | 0.1636 |\n27\t| Overlap/ZH (∩/ZH) | 0.2233 |\n28\t| EN-only tokens | 11,572 |\n29\t| ZH-only tokens | 7,876 |\n30\t| Overlap as % of vocab | 1.49% |\n31\t\n32\t### Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct (vocab size: 128,000)\n33\t\n34\t| Metric | Value |\n35\t|--------|-------|\n36\t| Unique EN token IDs | 16,394 |\n37\t| Unique ZH token IDs | 7,020 |\n38\t| Intersection (EN∩ZH) | 3,077 |\n39\t| Union (EN∪ZH) | 20,337 |\n40\t| **Jaccard** (∩/∪) | **0.1513** |\n41\t| Overlap/EN (∩/EN) | 0.1877 |\n42\t| Overlap/ZH (∩/ZH) | 0.4383 |\n43\t| EN-only tokens | 13,317 |\n44\t| ZH-only tokens | 3,943 |\n45\t| Overlap as % of vocab | 2.40% |\n46\t\n47\t## Key Observations\n48\t\n49\t1. **Llama 的 ZH→EN overlap 显著高于 Qwen (43.8% vs 22.3%)**：Llama tokenizer 缺乏专用中文 token，将中文文本拆成更多 byte-level 或共享 subword token，导致 ZH token 集合更小（7,020 vs 10,140）且与 EN 重叠更大。\n50\t\n51\t2. **Qwen 的 ZH token 集合更大且更独立**：Qwen tokenizer 有专门的中文 token（vocab 151K vs 128K），ZH 使用了 10,140 个 unique token，EN-ZH 分离度更高。\n52\t\n53\t3. **对跨语言探针迁移的含义**：\n54\t   - Llama 的高 token overlap 可能有利于 EN→ZH 探针迁移（共享更多 token-level 表示）\n55\t   - Qwen 的低 overlap 意味着跨语言迁移必须更多依赖语义层面（higher layers）而非 token 层面的共享表示\n56\t\n57\t## Script\n58\t\n59\t`/root/clkc_mech_interp/src/token_overlap.py`"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01F4qgMk8uE7Lx2WdRXGpbNh","session_id":"347907fb-725a-460a-a196-d1b396a4fd53","uuid":"b58b7c81-ec01-4e95-a8aa-14fcc4b67db0","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:22:45.973Z"}
